      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Malone sits along a shortline of the Puget Sound and Pacific Railroad, connecting it to regional timber routes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malone%2C_Washington",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Malone operated under complete company control, with workers living in company houses rather than independent homes.",
