        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://unitedstatesghosttowns.com/malone-washington-ghost-town/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Today, mill foundations and abandoned buildings whisper stories of this forgotten lumber town’s heyday.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
